// Asked for by the user: read the manual "คู่มือการทบทวนผลสัมฤทธิ์ เป้าหมาย แนวทางการดำเนินงานและตัวชี้วัดของแผนงานบูรณาการ ปีงบประมาณ พ.ศ. 2567"
// (Budget Bureau, Evaluation Division 2, Nov 2565) and design a menu that supports the work it describes (P35); then (P36):
//   - the KPI detail is a three-step pop-up as in the user's pictures: 1 basic data (item, name, kind, unit, criterion, formula),
//     2 target values (cumulative or not; by month, quarter or year; totals made by the system), 3 estimates (3, 5, 10, 15 or 20 years:
//     the plan of the years to come, the result of the years gone by);
//   - an integrated plan is CHOSEN from the programmes of the strategy structure whose kind is "integrated" (แผนงานบูรณาการ);
//   - three headings, each with many entries and each entry with KPIs, as in the agency review: 1 expected outcomes, 2 goals of the
//     integrated plan (long, medium, this year), 3 approaches;
//   - projects under the plan: when we are the main host a project of ours is taken from the register of outputs/projects (the
//     outputs under the plan's programme come first); the outputs/projects of the other agencies are typed in with their details.
// What the manual says, and where this page follows it (page numbers are the manual's own):
//   - two roles (p.12-22): the main host of the plan and the units that hold integrated budget; the units that hold budget make the plans of
//     their projects (3.1.4); the main host reviews, screens and sends to the Bureau (60 days before the budget request; operation and
//     spending plans 15 days before the fiscal year); quarterly reports 15 days after each quarter (3.2.1), year report 60 days (3.3.1).
//   - what a plan holds (p.26-28): outcome, goals (long, medium, this year), approaches, and a KPI at each level, each calculated from the
//     level below it (bottom-up, p.23, p.31). Three kinds of integration (p.25). Overlaps by target group and area (p.22).
//   - the review checklist (p.30-32): 10 groups, 24 items, answered Yes / No with a reason; the system answers 15 of them from the data.
// Roles: Planning keeps the plans and sends them; a division adds and edits only its own projects; the executive approves or returns;
// the auditor and the administrator read. Sample rows (3 programmes of the kind integrated, their outputs, 3 plans) are samples of mine.
// P37 (18 Nov 2569): the concept of a REVIEW is to bring the data of the year before and save it as the data of this year: a new plan
//   takes its outcomes, goals, approaches, KPIs, agencies and projects from the plan of the previous year for the same programme
//   (the checklist starts empty); the plan tab says where it came from. The kind of KPI has no "percent" any more (a percent KPI is a
//   quantity KPI with the unit "ร้อยละ"); step 3 of the KPI shows 3 years gone by, whatever the number of years to come.
// Not built: the real BB EvMIS exchange (a prototype); the e-MENSCR links by node (a text field holds them).

